               PERFORM COMPUTE-CC-RATING-0009.
               PERFORM CHECK-CC-RATING-0010.
               PERFORM AUDIT-HOUSE-TYPE-0011.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-HOUSE-TYPE-0012.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-AGENT-CODE-0013.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0014.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-PREMIUM-0015.
               PERFORM REFRESH-PREMIUM-0016.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
